# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  NEVER PUBLISH — assessment material and student data
#  These folders are blocked wholesale. Nothing inside them can be
#  committed, even with `git add`, unless this file is changed first.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
06_Quizzes/
07_Exams/
11_Grades_and_Rubrics/

