# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Build artefacts and large working files
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SCORM packages — built for Blackboard, not distributed via the repo
**/*_SCORM/
**/*_SCORM.zip

# Source PowerPoints — large working files (published lecture is the HTML)
03_Lectures/**/*.pptx

# Dataset generators and raw sources — instructor-only.
# The generator reveals how synthetic teaching data is built; the raw
# source is the unprocessed API dump. Students get the prepared files only.
09_Datasets/**/_build_data.py
09_Datasets/**/_source_*
09_Datasets/**/_clean_reference*

# Scaffold placeholders — noise, not content
**/_PLACEHOLDER.md
**/DROP_SYLLABUS_HERE.md

